# --manifest twice
$ skills sync-manifest --manifest <WORLD>/absent.manifest --manifest <WORLD>/overlay.manifest
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
sync-manifest: 1 added, 1 dropped, 0 retagged
--- stderr ---

--- overlay.manifest ---
alpha/SKILL.md custom

# --manifest as the last word: the default is read
$ skills sync-manifest --manifest
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
sync-manifest: 1 added, 1 dropped, 0 retagged
